        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "短暂停顿后，缓慢将杠铃放回起始姿势，确保完全放到底。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a one second contraction at the top, slowly lower the dumbbells back to the starting position." : {
      "comment" : "A step of how to do the exercise “Rear Delt Raise - Head on Bench (Dumbbell)”.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
