    "Continue alternating your left and right arms, whipping the ropes up and down as fast as you can." : {
      "comment" : "A step of how to do the exercise “Battle Rope Wave”.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "واصل التناوب بين ذراعيك اليسرى واليمنى، مضربًا بالحبلين لأعلى ولأسفل بأسرع ما يمكن."
