            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "前脚发力蹬地，将后脚收回，站直。双腿交替。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drive through your heels to lift your hips until your torso and thighs are in line." : {
      "comment" : "A step of how to do the exercise “Hip Thrust (Machine)”.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
