          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Execute the pass by exploding forward and outward with the hips while pushing the ball as far as possible." : {
      "comment" : "A step of how to do the exercise “Chest Push - Single Response (Medicine Ball)”.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "أدِّ التمريرة بالانطلاق إلى الأمام وإلى الخارج بالوركين مع دفع الكرة إلى أبعد مسافة ممكنة."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Führe den Pass aus, indem du die Hüfte explosiv nach vorn und außen treibst und den Ball dabei so weit wie möglich wegdrückst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ejecuta el pase explotando hacia delante y hacia fuera con las caderas mientras empujas el balón lo más lejos posible."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Exécutez la passe en projetant les hanches de façon explosive vers l'avant et vers l'extérieur tout en poussant le ballon aussi loin que possible."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "कूल्हों से आगे और बाहर की ओर विस्फोटक ज़ोर लगाते हुए और बॉल को जितना दूर हो सके धकेलते हुए पास दें।"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "股関節を前方・外側へ爆発的に動かしながら、ボールをできるだけ遠くへ押し出してパスします。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Execute o passe explodindo com o quadril para a frente e para fora, empurrando a bola o mais longe possível."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Выполните передачу, взрывно подавая бёдра вперёд и наружу и толкая мяч как можно дальше."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "髋部向前向外爆发发力，同时尽可能远地推球，完成传球。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Execute the pass by exploding forward and outward with the hips while pushing the ball as hard as possible." : {
      "comment" : "A step of how to do the exercise “Chest Push - Multiple Response (Medicine Ball)”.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
