            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "立った姿勢で、体の横に一対のダンベルを持ちます。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Em pé, segure um par de halteres ao lado do corpo."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Встаньте прямо, держа пару гантелей по бокам."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "站立，双手各持一个哑铃放在身体两侧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In a standing position, hold a pair of dumbbells at your side. This will be your starting position." : {
      "comment" : "A step of how to do the exercise “Lateral to Front Raise (Dumbbell)”.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
