        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将绳索移到滑轮塔的最下方，选择合适的重量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move the cables to the bottom of the towers and select an appropriate weight." : {
      "comment" : "A step of how to do the exercise “Standing Shoulder Press (Cable)”.",
