        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "कोहनी को सीधा करके मूवमेंट करें, अपनी निचली बाजू को ऊपरी बाजू से दूर खींचते हुए।"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "肘を伸ばして、前腕を上腕から遠ざけるように引くことで動作を行います。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Execute o movimento estendendo o cotovelo, afastando o antebraço do braço."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Выполните движение, разгибая локоть и отводя предплечье от плеча."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "伸展肘关节完成动作，将前臂拉离上臂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Perform the movement by flexing the elbow, pulling your lower arm towards your upper arm." : {
      "comment" : "A step of how to do the exercise “Bicep Curl (Machine)”.",
