    "Press yourself back up to the starting position by extending the elbows. Breathe out as you perform this step." : {
      "comment" : "A step of how to do the exercise “Push Up - Close Grip (Dumbbell)”.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ادفع جسمك للأعلى إلى وضع البداية بمد المرفقين. ازفر أثناء أداء هذه الخطوة."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drück dich durch Strecken der Ellbogen zurück in die Ausgangsposition. Atme bei diesem Schritt aus."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Empuja para volver a la posición inicial extendiendo los codos. Exhala mientras haces este paso."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Repoussez-vous jusqu'à la position de départ en étendant les coudes. Expirez pendant cette étape."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "कोहनियों को सीधा करते हुए खुद को वापस शुरुआती स्थिति में प्रेस करें। यह कदम करते समय साँस छोड़ें।"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "肘を伸ばして、開始姿勢まで押し上げます。このステップは息を吐きながら行います。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Empurre-se de volta à posição inicial estendendo os cotovelos. Expire durante esta etapa."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Выжмите себя обратно в исходное положение, разгибая локти. Выдыхайте на этом этапе."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "伸展肘部，将自己推回起始姿势。做这一步时呼气。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pressing mainly with the heel of the foot and squeezing the thighs, go back up as you breathe out." : {
      "comment" : "A step of how to do the exercise “Hack Squat (Barbell)”.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "بالدفع بكعب القدم بشكل أساسي وعصر الفخذين، اصعد مع الزفير."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drücke dich hauptsächlich über die Ferse ab, spanne die Oberschenkel an und gehe beim Ausatmen wieder nach oben."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Empujando principalmente con el talón y apretando los muslos, sube mientras exhalas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En poussant principalement avec le talon et en serrant les cuisses, remontez en expirant."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "मुख्य रूप से पैर की एड़ी से धक्का देते हुए और जांघों को भींचते हुए, सांस छोड़ते हुए वापस ऊपर जाएं।"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主にかかとで押し、太ももを締めながら、息を吐いて立ち上がります。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Empurrando principalmente com o calcanhar e contraindo as coxas, suba enquanto expira."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Отталкиваясь в основном пяткой и напрягая бёдра, поднимайтесь вверх на выдохе."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主要用脚跟发力，同时夹紧大腿，呼气，起身回到起始位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pressing through the heel of your foot, return to the starting position." : {
      "comment" : "A step of how to do the exercise “Lunge Pass Through (Kettlebell)”.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
