        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将把手拉向躯干，肘部向后带，同时夹紧肩胛骨。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pull the handles towards your torso, retracting your shoulder blades as you flex the elbow." : {
      "comment" : "A step of how to do the exercise “Lever High Row (Machine)”.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
