    "Raise the side of your torso up by laterally flexing at the waist while exhaling." : {
      "comment" : "A step of how to do the exercise “Side Bend (Stability Ball)”.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
