          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Raise your legs straight up so they point at the ceiling, or bend your knees to make it easier." : {
      "comment" : "A step of how to do the exercise “Lying Windshield Wiper”.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
