            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将哑铃放回肩部，完成这一组，然后换边。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Return slowly and complete your reps before switching legs." : {
      "comment" : "A step of how to do the exercise “Glute Kickback (Machine)”.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
