          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slowly begin to bring the curl bar back to starting position as you breathe in." : {
      "comment" : "A step of how to do the exercise “Bicep Curl (Cable)”.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ابدأ ببطء بإعادة بار الكيرل إلى وضع البداية مع الشهيق."
          }
