    "Violently throw the ball forward, flexing at the hip and using your whole body to complete the movement." : {
      "comment" : "A step of how to do the exercise “Standing Two Arm Overhead Throw (Medicine Ball)”.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
